# Paper D is an isolated workspace. Nothing here is committable until its rights decision is
# recorded in benchmarks/registry/distribution.yaml.
#
# inputs/ will hold authoritative Fannie Mae and federal source bytes plus imported
# policy-to-knowledge stage artifacts. artifacts/ will hold generated development output. Both
# are ignored BEFORE the first import, because this repository has already had to purge two
# corpora from every commit after tracked bytes preceded the decision that should have stopped
# them.
#
# Note the `*` forms. `inputs/` and `artifacts/` would exclude the directories themselves, and
# git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded -- which silently defeats the
# !.gitkeep negations below. That asymmetry is recorded in
# studies/paper-c-specialize-align-mortgage-v1/provenance/MIGRATION_MANIFEST.json.
inputs/*
!inputs/.gitkeep
artifacts/*
!artifacts/.gitkeep

build/
.env
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
